# Uploaded files don't belong in version control — only the folder structure does.
*
!.gitignore
!*/
!*/.gitkeep

# Exceptions: the site logo/footer brand images are referenced directly by the app
# (Navbar, Login, Signup, Footer) and need to exist on every deploy, not just this
# dev machine — everything else in this folder stays untracked as before.
!store/Pashuseva logo light.jpeg
!store/pashuseva-png.png
